# GPL-2.0. The fork IS the ready-to-build driver for mainline 7.1; the only
# forge-local delta is the arm_rk.mk aarch64/platform_ops adaptation
# (patches/rk3568-atk/linux/00xx-wifi-rtl8852bs-forge-adapt.patch).
#
# main tracks the fork's ongoing mainline work. See document/notes/42.
